WEBVTT

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:59.790
Yep, all good.

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:05.000
Cinnamon, I need to cool the noodles.
Get some ice ready, please.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.040
Yes.

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:13.040
What's wrong, Cinnamon? Hurry--

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:15.040
Heaven...

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:16.500
What are you doing?

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:29.120
Oh, I can have that, too? Mm...

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:33.120
Sloppy as always.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.330
Azuki, please take this as well.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.290
Yes.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.250
Great weather...

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:57.290
It's very hot today as well.

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:05.080
Cinnamon, 92.5 centimeters.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.500
You've gotten bigger again.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.620
Wh-What?! Is there no limit to this?!

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.830
Even though Azuki hasn't changed at all!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:15.370
Y-You--! You wanna fight?!

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:16.580
--I'm just telling the truth.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:17.410
--And so it begins. Again.
--I'm just telling the truth.

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:20.910
--And so it begins. Again.
--What?! You good-for-nothing giant!

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.620
--We're home!
--Better than being tiny!

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:25.040
Like I said, this is technically
not "home" anymore.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:26.910
Welcome.

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:30.120
Health checks have already begun.

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:33.160
Come to the living room
when you're ready, okay?

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:37.700
Okay, pull your chin back a bit.

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:40.870
--Okay.
--Yes, good.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:42.790
Stay still for just a moment.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:45.200
Cacao, 109 centimeters.

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:48.160
Cacao, 109 centimeters, right.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:51.290
Yes, you're growing steadily.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.790
Cacao is growing steadily!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:04:00.700
We are raising her well.

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:02.330
Yes! Yes!

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:07.500
At this rate, isn't she going
to outgrow Azuki really soon?

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.750
Huh? That's not possible.

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:14.790
Who knows? When I was her age,
I was already bigger than Azuki.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.040
Huh?! You're so full of hot air.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.410
What?! Are you making fun
of how puffy my face is?!

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:23.500
That's not what that means! Do you
have potato salad jammed in your ears?!

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:24.790
What?!

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:26.040
You want some?!

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:40.790
Well... Azuki and Coconut haven't
shown any signs of growth in this area.

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:48.620
Let's wrap this up with our favorite:
the kinetic eyesight test.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:50.250
Yes.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:54.790
Remember? You're supposed to tell
what the quick thing on the screen is.

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:59.080
Please pay attention.

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.120
Here it comes.

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.540
"I really, really, really, really,
really love Shigure-<i>sama</i>"

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.750
Okay, those who got it, say at once!

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:14.410
I really, really, really, really,
really love Shigure-<i>sama</i>.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:15.830
Correct.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.830
Okay, here's the next one.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:21.330
"I want to be by Shigure-<i>sama</i>'s side
even if it gets hot"

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:26.660
I want to be by Shigure-<i>sama</i>'s side
even if it gets hot.

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:30.450
Great. Everyone, you're 100% correct.

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:33.250
Okay, this next one is a bit long.

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:36.750
"We want Shigure-<i>sama </i>to take
many photos of us even if they're a bit spicy"

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:42.950
We want Shigure-<i>sama </i>to take
many photos of us even if they're a bit spicy...

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:48.580
Um... Please don't entrap us like that...

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:54.080
The fact that you caught that
is proof that you've all grown...

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:11.120
This is a watermelon. Try it, it's good.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:18.120
See? Like this.

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:25.330
Mm, yummy.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:42.750
Hmm? What is it?

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:49.790
Oh, that's the seed. You have to spit it out.

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:55.200
If you swallow it, watermelons start
to grow out of your belly button.

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:05.750
Watch, Cacao. Chocola will
show you how to do it.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:18.620
Oh, that could be Cacao's first gaze
of respect towards Chocola.

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:21.080
Huh?! This is the first?!

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.950
--Yes.
--Oh no...

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:27.080
But really, this is, like, textbook summer.

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:32.620
I know. When I was boiling the noodles,
I got all sweaty and icky.

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:38.330
But sweating a lot is good
for keeping in shape...

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:40.950
I don't need to go on a diet!

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:45.160
Really? But I like it when you're plumpy.

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:47.450
I said I'm not plumpy!

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:52.450
When it's hot like this, it makes me
want to go to the beach.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:53.870
Oh, good idea.

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:59.040
Remember the time we went to
the beach after the health checkup?

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:03.120
That time, we only dipped
our feet into the water.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:08.200
So let's go for a proper swim this time!

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.250
Chocola would love to go to the beach, too!

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:11.660
Same here.

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:14.040
Sounds good.

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:15.290
Then let's go right away...

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:16.330
No.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:22.370
There's something we must do first.

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:36.500
Shopping for swimwear?
That's the big thing to do?

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:41.000
Shigure-<i>sama </i>looked so serious,
it made me wonder what she was going to say.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:45.750
What are you talking about?
This is Cacao's first proper swimming trip.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:49.200
We must pick the cutest swimwear for her.

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:55.040
Chocola agrees that we should
get Cacao something super cute,

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:58.290
but does everyone else need a new set?

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:03.500
I agree. I'll be okay wearing the one
you got for me last summer.

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:09.830
I-I might actually like to get a new one...

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:12.830
Last year's might not fit...

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:24.540
I think I'd look good in
an adult one, like this one.

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:29.200
What are you talking about?
You'd do just fine with a loincloth.

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:31.540
Why?!

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:35.700
May-<i>chan</i>, I think you'd look good
with something like this.

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:41.750
Sure, if I wanted to get arrested!

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:46.330
Really? I think it'd look good on you...

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.620
What would look good on Cacao?

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:55.700
Chocola, the ones for Cacao are over there.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:03.540
The one Chocola picked for Cacao is...

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:04.580
...this!

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.540
I picked...

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:10.580
...this.

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:15.450
The final special one is...

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:16.500
...this!

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:20.580
Not that one.

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:22.120
Agreed.

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:27.160
Right. Now that we've purchased
everyone's swimwear,

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:29.580
let's take a break then head home.

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:32.660
Oh, then let's go to
the food court downstairs!

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:37.500
The <i>taiyaki </i>there are great!
They're extra-packed with red bean paste!

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:40.000
What?! That sounds great! Let's go, let's go!

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.200
Cacao... Where are you going...?

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:51.450
Cacao?

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:58.620
Cacao, unfortunately, you can't eat that one.

00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:03.620
This one is for floating
on the ocean, and riding on.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:14.700
Cinnamon, you made her more interested in it.

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:15.870
What?!

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:22.160
Shigure-<i>chan</i>, thank you.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.620
Not only did you get us
new swimwear, but this, too...

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:26.750
It's fine.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:30.290
I intend to make it worth every penn spent.

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:42.830
Cacao, before going to the beach,
there is a test you need to clear.

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:44.870
Which is...

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:46.790
...to put your face in the water!

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:52.370
Chocola will show you an example, so watch.

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:00.120
Now you try.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:11.370
Don't give Chocola that look.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:15.330
This is the minimum requirement
for enjoying the beach.

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:22.500
Come on. Chocola will join you.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:26.410
Ready? On three.

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:29.910
One, two... three!

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:46.040
Wow, Cacao! You did it!

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:49.160
Chocola, you're so easily tricked.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.160
Huh?

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:56.120
Going to the beach?
Sure, as long as it's not a work day.

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:06.410
I see.

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:09.250
Let's meet up at the beach at noon, then.

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:19.870
See you.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:30.750
Chocola, I can see you worked hard, but...

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:34.120
You need to inflate that at the beach.

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:35.830
Oh, no!

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:54.790
There!

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:12.040
This will be our home base!

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:14.910
Why are you acting all
"in control" all of a sudden?

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:16.500
Hey, everyone!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:19.790
Thanks for waiting!

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:28.250
Okay, now that we're all here...

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.450
Swimming time!

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:36.660
There!

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:47.540
"Celebrating the opening
of the love tunnel"

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.580
Right! Right! Chopstick hand!

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:10.080
Not that way!

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:12.250
Good! Straight ahead!

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:20.620
Why only me?!

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:24.040
Because you've got melons.

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:30.330
Hmm, really?

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:36.830
My collection grows richer...

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:40.660
What's wrong, Vanilla?

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:43.660
Oh, no... Cacao is missing.

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:50.290
"Restrooms"

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:56.750
--Did you find her?
--No...

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:59.370
Hey! There she is!

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:07.700
If she gets washed out to sea,
it'll be bad!

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:09.160
Then Chocola will--!

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:12.200
No! We have to get a lifeguard...

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:13.580
I'll go.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:37.660
Thank you so much. I don't know
how to thank you enough...

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:40.830
You have our greatest degree of thanks.

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:44.120
U-Um, Chocola also gives that thanks.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:47.410
Oh, no, I just did what anyone would do...

00:16:47.410 --> 00:16:48.540
No!

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:53.870
Saving our cat is the same
as saving my own life.

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:56.000
Please, let me repay you in some way.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.330
Um...

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:02.950
Well, in that case,
can you come to my shop?

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:05.160
Shop?

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:08.620
"Beach Clubhouse
Orange"

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:12.120
These fried noodles are delicious!

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:14.040
The ramen noodles are great, too.

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:20.120
For a seaside clubhouse,
this is quite adequate...

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:24.160
Or rather, quite good.

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:26.290
The location is not the best, but...

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:33.200
The lack of patronage must be due
to lack of advertisement and attention.

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:40.200
As a token of our gratitude, we will make
this place the most popular on the beach.

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:41.370
Huh?

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.370
"Beach Clubhouse Orange HERE!"
"Barbecued corn, fried noodles,
shaved ice and more!!"

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:47.160
Beach Clubhouse Orange is in business!

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:50.450
Cute cats everywhere!

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:53.830
Mm, delicious!

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:59.410
That "Orange" shop at the edge
of the beach sure is delicious!

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:01.450
I know, right? So good.

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:09.540
♪ Magic makes it shine on,
you and the witches ♪

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:16.540
We're working at
Beach Clubhouse Orange today!

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:18.410
Please visit us for some special service!

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:20.370
"Beach Clubhouse Orange GO!!"
"Beach Clubhouse Orange! Nearby"
Please visit us for some special service!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:21.700
"Beach Clubhouse Orange GO!!"
"Beach Clubhouse Orange! Nearby"

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:24.160
Hey, take a look at that.

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:27.950
"At Beach Clubhouse 'Orange',
our cats will be waiting for you!"
"First in the business,
a beach restaurant with cats"?

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:31.950
Sounds fun, let's take a look!

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:33.160
Yeah!

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:37.950
Really...?

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:42.200
"Beach Clubhouse
Orange"
So many customers...?

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:46.290
Barbecued corn and frankfurter, coming up!

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:50.700
One lemon shaved ice and
one sweet milk shaved ice, understood.

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:54.750
Wow, it's hot. At this rate,
I'm gonna get cooked, too.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:18:59.620
Thank you for waiting!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.410
Sis, I'll take this curry!

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:07.370
Yes, thanks.

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:11.000
I'm sorry to make you help in the kitchen, too,
after you've done so much already.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:16.700
Please don't worry. We owe you for
saving a precious member of our family.

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:20.120
Excuse me, can we order?

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:22.620
Y-Yes! Right away!

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:26.580
Someone, please take her order!

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:28.950
Sorry! Too busy over here!

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:31.120
--What?!
--Um...

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:33.080
U-Um, please wait one moment--

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:35.330
Go ahead.

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:37.080
Oh, yes...

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:39.580
"Beach Clubhouse
Orange"
"Closed"

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:41.830
Wow, we worked hard today.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:43.500
I know, right?

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:47.290
I thought we came to play,
how did we end up like this?

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:50.410
Well, we had fun, right?

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:53.410
Thank you very much for today.

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:56.160
We're so glad to be of service.

00:19:56.160 --> 00:20:02.290
We inherited this shop from our parents,
and it has never been this popular.

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:05.620
It's thanks to Shigure's plans all working out.

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:07.750
Great as always, Shigure-<i>sama</i>!

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:13.080
It's thanks to your hard work.
Thank you all very much.

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:16.450
Cacao, you worked very hard, too!

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:18.200
Cacao is a good girl.

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:21.080
I had lots of fun, too!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:30.750
But... we were only popular today
because the kitties were here...

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:35.200
Um, about that.

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:39.500
There's something I'd like to discuss.

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:49.830
Coming up next, the super popular
beach clubhouse with cats!

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:51.080
Huh?

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:54.910
Hi, everyone, please come visit us
at Beach Clubhouse Orange!

00:20:54.910 --> 00:20:57.040
Can't wait to see you!

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:59.290
Is this...?

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:02.290
Yes, they seemed like nice people,

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:05.830
so I introduced them to some cats
who were looking for a home.

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:12.080
They say cats bring good luck.
Now that clubhouse is destined for success.

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:15.540
Also...

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:19.910
There is nothing better than life with cats.

00:22:59.660 --> 00:23:00.700
Hey!

00:23:10.870 --> 00:23:12.750
Welcome!

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:15.160
Welcome to La Soleil!

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:21.870
"Illustrated by Sayori"
"Thanks for watching meow!"
